        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bokor Hill Station\n- Products: City of Ghosts, R-Point\n- Events: Vietnam War\n- People: Kam Woo-sung, Son Byong-ho\n- Organizations: South Korean military\n\nFacts:\n- The film \"City of Ghosts\" was released in 2002.\n- Bokor Hill Station was used as the location for the final showdown of the 2002 film \"City of Ghosts\".\n- The film \"R-Point\" was released in 2004.\n- Bokor Hill Station was used as a location for the 2004 film \"R-Point\".\n- \"R-Point\" is set in Vietnam in 1972 during the Vietnam War.\n- \"R-Point\" stars Kam Woo-sung and Son Byong-ho as members of the South Korean military in Vietnam.",
